{"ID":"20240118151218-c386yio","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151218-c386yio","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151218-c386yio\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151218-18raquz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114211-neqgn3l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114211-neqgn3l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:213,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:213\u0026#125;","title":"133蒲萄（葡萄）","type":"doc","updated":"20240130161858"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151218-18raquz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151218-18raquz","updated":"20240122114151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主筋骨湿痹：益气倍力，强志，令人肥健耐饥，忍风寒，久服轻身，不老延年，可作酒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114154-3p0q9tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114154-3p0q9tz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多种植园区山地之间，美法诸国盛产之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114158-6hacojk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114158-6hacojk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘涩，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114200-craq56n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114200-craq56n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蒲萄主补身益气养血，治筋骨湿痹，作酒用良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114201-c4wgxz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114201-c4wgxz2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】逐水，利小便。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114202-uuior8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114202-uuior8s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】除肠间水，调中治淋。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114203-ja6vb40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114203-ja6vb40"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】时气痘疮不出，食之或研酒饮之效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114204-ehidr2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114204-ehidr2z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】补益筋骨，滋养肌肉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114205-5ax3idd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114205-5ax3idd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通做食品，入药无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114206-n3hmmzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114206-n3hmmzy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多食令人卒烦闷眼暗，东南商人食之多病热，西北人食之无恙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114206-07c5wyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114206-07c5wyi"}},{"ID":"20240122114207-lviap1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114207-lviap1n","updated":"20240130161818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那蒲萄呢，就是我们的葡萄，那葡萄呢，水果类的，我们常常可以食用的是葡萄。所以诸位你看他都没把凤梨写进来，西瓜、凤梨，莲雾，葡萄他有他的道理，所以没事就吃吃葡萄。这个《神农本草经》里面果类的东西，果实类的东西，大枣啊，葡萄。我平常在诊所看病的时候我就吃个葡萄，吃葡萄的时候你们最好买那个比较原始的葡萄，有皮啊有籽的，连皮带籽一起通通吃下去，这个葡萄不但可以保养牙齿对身体也很好，同时呢筋骨湿痹：益气倍力，可以常吃的。葡萄补身益气养血。那你养血的葡萄，绝对不是，我们有青色的跟黑色的暗色的葡萄，你要养血一定要找红色的黑色的才有，找那个青色的它不养血。但是你可以看它的颜色，葡萄是滋补身体的，青色的一定入肝，红色的一定入心，黑色的一定入肾，你这样子想就好了，用意，可以以意得之。能够排水，利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240122114211-neqgn3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114211-neqgn3l","updated":"20240130161858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是我平常就在吃的，那徐灵胎说能够补益筋骨，滋养肌肉。所以我没事在诊所里放的就是蔗糖，一块一块的，我丢在嘴巴里来吃，想吃点蔗糖，站太久了脚筋骨有点抽筋，就丢个蔗糖，平常就吃个葡萄，多补啊，你不要没事就在那边吃多种维他命，吃完这个还要吃ABCD什么的，实在害死人，花钱买祸，葡萄非常好。那禁忌呢，多食令人烦闷，怎么样，东南商人吃之多病热，西北人吃了没有关系。这个我不了解，实际上葡萄你吃多会有这种情形，我想是因为这个他吃太过量了，太过量了有这种反应，实际上我不太认为是这样子。"}]}]}